{"seq":3,"slug":"chargeback-rate-monitor","title":"拒付率监控与网络阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/chargeback-rate-monitor","wordCount":1854,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"拒付率监控与网络阈值\">拒付率监控与网络阈值</h1><p>拒付率不是你以为的那个数。分子只算正式拒付（预警与调档不算），分母可能是交易笔数也可能是交易金额，统计窗口按月滚动，而阈值按<strong>商户</strong>或<strong>收单机构</strong>层级考核——四个口径只要错一个，你的内部看板就会和网络给你的通知差出几倍。更麻烦的是，卡组织的监控计划有多个，标准与后果各不相同：Visa 的 VAMP（Acquirer Monitoring Program，前身为 VFMP/豪客监控体系）与 Mastercard 的 ECP（Excessive Chargeback Program）各自定义比率、分级与处罚。这一篇讲清楚比率的算法、阈值机制、以及平台侧应该怎么建前置预警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-比率的分子分母\">核心概念：比率的分子分母</h2><p>先固定定义。拒付率（chargeback ratio）在业务上通常指：</p>\n<h3 id=\"两个口径不可互推\">两个口径不可互推</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>拒付率</mtext><mtext>笔数</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>当期拒付笔数</mtext><mtext>当期交易笔数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>拒付率</mtext><mtext>金额</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>当期拒付金额</mtext><mtext>当期交易金额</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{拒付率}_{\\text{笔数}} = \\frac{\\text{当期拒付笔数}}{\\text{当期交易笔数}}, \\qquad \\text{拒付率}_{\\text{金额}} = \\frac{\\text{当期拒付金额}}{\\text{当期交易金额}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">拒付率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">笔数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当期交易笔数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当期拒付笔数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">拒付率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">金额</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当期交易金额</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当期拒付金额</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两者不可互推：低价高频业务下笔数比率天然偏高，高价低频业务下金额比率更容易触线。Visa 的 VAMP 引入了<strong>同时考核笔数与金额</strong>的思路（具体阈值以最新版 Visa 公布为准），因此只看一个口径会漏掉风险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分子分母的界定表\">分子分母的界定表</h3><p>分子分母的界定细节才是工程难点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分子是否含预警</td>\n<td>把 pre-dispute 预警计入</td>\n<td>只计正式拒付（见 sibling 预警篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分子是否含调档</td>\n<td>把 retrieval 计入</td>\n<td>retrieval 不计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分子是否含已反败为胜的</td>\n<td>只看发生不看结果</td>\n<td>按网络口径，通常按发生计，不因后续赢回而扣减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分母是笔数还是金额</td>\n<td>只算一种</td>\n<td>两种都算并各自预警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分母是否含退款交易</td>\n<td>把退款也算交易</td>\n<td>按网络定义的 eligible transactions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计窗口</td>\n<td>用自然月</td>\n<td>用网络定义的滚动期，注意交易日与清算日的差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行最容易在实际对账时暴露：<strong>网络用的是清算口径与滚动窗口</strong>，你用交易日与自然月，两者在月末与假期前后会有明显偏差。内部预警必须采用网络口径，否则你会比网络的通知晚发现、或者被误报吓到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值机制与后果\">阈值机制与后果</h2><p>两个网络的监控计划在结构上相似：按月评估、设<strong>标准阈值</strong>与<strong>超额阈值</strong>两档、超额后进入观察或处罚流程、并提供申诉通道。具体数值与生效条件会随规则版本变化，工程上必须<strong>配置化并标注来源版本</strong>，不要写死。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;monitoring_programs&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;network&quot;: &quot;visa&quot;,&#10;      &quot;program&quot;: &quot;VAMP&quot;,&#10;      &quot;ruleset_version&quot;: &quot;2026.1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;metrics&quot;: [&quot;count_ratio&quot;, &quot;amount_ratio&quot;],&#10;      &quot;thresholds&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;standard&quot;: { &quot;count_ratio_bp&quot;: null, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;以最新 Visa 公布为准&quot; },&#10;        &quot;excessive&quot;: { &quot;count_ratio_bp&quot;: null, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;以最新 Visa 公布为准&quot; }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;consequences&quot;: [&quot;monitoring&quot;, &quot;fees&quot;, &quot;remediation_plan&quot;, &quot;potential_termination&quot;],&#10;      &quot;appeal_window_days&quot;: null&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;network&quot;: &quot;mastercard&quot;,&#10;      &quot;program&quot;: &quot;ECP&quot;,&#10;      &quot;ruleset_version&quot;: &quot;2026.1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;metrics&quot;: [&quot;count_ratio&quot;, &quot;amount_ratio&quot;],&#10;      &quot;thresholds&quot;: { &quot;standard&quot;: {}, &quot;excessive&quot;: {} },&#10;      &quot;consequences&quot;: [&quot;warning&quot;, &quot;fees&quot;, &quot;program_enrollment&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"monitoring_programs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"network\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"visa\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"program\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VAMP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ruleset_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"thresholds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"count_ratio_bp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"以最新 Visa 公布为准\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"excessive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"count_ratio_bp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"以最新 Visa 公布为准\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"consequences\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"monitoring\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fees\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"remediation_plan\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"potential_termination\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"appeal_window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"network\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mastercard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"program\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ECP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ruleset_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"thresholds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"excessive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {} },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"consequences\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fees\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"program_enrollment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>thresholds</code> 留空而标注「以最新公布为准」是刻意的：<strong>本文不编造具体倍数</strong>，因为这些数字按网络、按地区、按时点变化，写错的值比没有值更危险。工程上要做的是让这张表可维护——规则更新时只需改配置并重启，不需要发版。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超额后的连锁后果\">超额后的连锁后果</h3><p>进入监控计划的后果是分层的，且<strong>每一层都会反向影响你的经营能力</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>监控（monitoring）</strong>：要求提交整改计划，增加报告义务。</li>\n<li><strong>费用（fees）</strong>：按笔或按月收取罚金，直接计入单案成本。</li>\n<li><strong>整改（remediation）</strong>：要求提高 3DS 覆盖、降低特定原因码、或调整业务模式。</li>\n<li><strong>极端情况</strong>：收单行可能终止服务或要求保证金，这会导致业务中断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第三层最关键：<strong>整改要求会落到你的工程路线图上</strong>。如果模型预测下个月会超额，你需要的不是「到时候再说」，而是提前两个月启动 3DS 覆盖提升或退款前置这类结构性动作（见 <a href=\"../prevention-liability/refund-first-intercept\">退款前置与拒付拦截</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台侧的分层预警\">平台侧的分层预警</h2><p>网络通知是<strong>滞后的</strong>——它按月评估，等你收到时当月的问题已经定型。平台侧必须建自己的前置预警，把时间提前到<strong>可干预</strong>的窗口内。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>提前量</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>趋势预警</td>\n<td>滚动比率升速异常</td>\n<td>数周</td>\n<td>排查是否某一商家/原因码集中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接近阈值</td>\n<td>预测值 &gt; 阈值 × 安全系数</td>\n<td>数周</td>\n<td>启动结构性降拒付动作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超阈值预测</td>\n<td>预测值 &gt; 阈值</td>\n<td>当月内</td>\n<td>应急：退款前置、预警自动处置加码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已超额</td>\n<td>网络口径确认超额</td>\n<td>事后</td>\n<td>申诉 + 整改计划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二层依赖<strong>预测</strong>，即用当月已发生的数据外推到月末（考虑交易量的日内/周内节律）。预测的价值在于把「已发生」变成「将发生」，从而留出干预时间。预测不必复杂——按已完成天数的比率与交易量节律外推通常足够，复杂模型的收益远小于提前几天发现的收益。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分维度的比率监控\">分维度的比率监控</h3><p>总量比率达标不代表安全，因为<strong>超额通常由少数商家或少数原因码驱动</strong>。监控必须下钻：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按商家与原因码定位比率贡献（滚动 30 天，网络口径）&#10;SELECT merchant_id,&#10;       frozen_reason_code,&#10;       SUM(is_chargeback)                          AS cb_count,&#10;       COUNT(*)                                    AS txn_count,&#10;       ROUND(SUM(is_chargeback) / COUNT(*), 5)     AS cb_ratio,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN is_chargeback THEN amount_value ELSE 0 END) AS cb_amount,&#10;       SUM(amount_value)                           AS txn_amount&#10;FROM dispute_metric_daily&#10;WHERE clearing_date &gt;= CURDATE() - INTERVAL 30 DAY&#10;  AND clearing_date &lt;  CURDATE()&#10;GROUP BY merchant_id, frozen_reason_code&#10;HAVING cb_count &gt;= 5&#10;ORDER BY cb_amount DESC&#10;LIMIT 50;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按商家与原因码定位比率贡献（滚动 30 天，网络口径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       frozen_reason_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(is_chargeback)                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(is_chargeback) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb_ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_chargeback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_value)                           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_metric_daily</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clearing_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURDATE() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clearing_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  CURDATE()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_id, frozen_reason_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ORDER BY cb_amount DESC</code> 而不是按比率排序，是因为<strong>降额最快的路径通常是处理金额最大且比率超标的组合</strong>。一个只看比率的看板会让你去处理一堆小额高比率的长尾，对总量影响微乎其微。</p>\n<p>另外两个下钻维度不可省：<strong>原因码</strong>（定位是欺诈问题还是履约问题）与<strong>支付方式</strong>（定位是卡种/地区问题）。欺诈类集中说明风控或 3DS 覆盖不足；消费者争议类集中说明履约或描述问题——两类问题的修复团队完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据管线的正确性\">数据管线的正确性</h2><p>比率的正确性完全依赖数据管线，三个必设的控制点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>口径冻结</strong>：分母的交易集合按网络定义生成（eligible transactions），不是订单表的全集。</li>\n<li><strong>对账</strong>：定期用网络提供的报告反查本地计算，差异超过阈值即告警，而不是等单位换算错误累积。</li>\n<li><strong>不可变</strong>：指标表按清算日分区、只追加不更新，避免历史数据被后续修正导致趋势失真。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对账这一项在实践中价值最高：<strong>它能在你被网络通知之前发现口径错误</strong>。常见差异来源包括：退款交易是否计入分母、跨币种金额的折算时点、以及争议发生日与清算日的归属。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拒付率有笔数与金额两个口径，VAMP/ECP 类计划通常同时关注，不可互推。</li>\n<li>分子只含正式拒付（预警与调档不计入）；分母用网络定义的 eligible transactions。</li>\n<li>统计口径用清算日与网络滚动窗口，不用交易日与自然月。</li>\n<li>阈值必须配置化并标注规则版本，不写死具体数值。</li>\n<li>网络通知滞后，平台侧需建分层前置预警，含「超阈值预测」这一档。</li>\n<li>下钻维度是商家、原因码、支付方式；按金额而非仅按比率排序定位问题。</li>\n<li>数据管线要口径冻结 + 定期对账 + 不可变追加。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[清算数据] --&gt; B[按网络口径生成 eligible 交易集]&#10;  A --&gt; C[标记正式拒付&lt;br/&gt;排除预警与调档]&#10;  B --&gt; D[计算笔数与金额比率]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[滚动窗口 + 分维度下钻]&#10;  E --&gt; F{预测月末值 vs 阈值}&#10;  F --&gt;|&lt; 安全系数| G[常规监控]&#10;  F --&gt;|&gt;= 安全系数| H[启动结构性降拒付]&#10;  F --&gt;|&gt;= 阈值| I[应急: 退款前置/预警加码]&#10;  E --&gt; J[与网络报告对账]&#10;  J --&gt;|差异超限| K[口径错误告警]\">flowchart TD\n  A[清算数据] --&gt; B[按网络口径生成 eligible 交易集]\n  A --&gt; C[标记正式拒付&lt;br/&gt;排除预警与调档]\n  B --&gt; D[计算笔数与金额比率]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[滚动窗口 + 分维度下钻]\n  E --&gt; F{预测月末值 vs 阈值}\n  F --&gt;|&lt; 安全系数| G[常规监控]\n  F --&gt;|&gt;= 安全系数| H[启动结构性降拒付]\n  F --&gt;|&gt;= 阈值| I[应急: 退款前置/预警加码]\n  E --&gt; J[与网络报告对账]\n  J --&gt;|差异超限| K[口径错误告警]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拒付率监控与网络阈值","id":"拒付率监控与网络阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：比率的分子分母","id":"核心概念-比率的分子分母"},{"level":3,"text":"两个口径不可互推","id":"两个口径不可互推"},{"level":3,"text":"分子分母的界定表","id":"分子分母的界定表"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值机制与后果","id":"阈值机制与后果"},{"level":3,"text":"超额后的连锁后果","id":"超额后的连锁后果"},{"level":2,"text":"平台侧的分层预警","id":"平台侧的分层预警"},{"level":3,"text":"分维度的比率监控","id":"分维度的比率监控"},{"level":2,"text":"数据管线的正确性","id":"数据管线的正确性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"胜诉率与败诉归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-case-ops/win-rate-root-cause"},"next":{"title":"3DS 责任转移证据留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/chargeback-dispute-representment/prevention-liability/3ds-liability-shift"}}